<title>FINLAND: Vaisala 1996 profit rises 24 percent.</title>
<headline>Vaisala 1996 profit rises 24 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 31,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items, tax     112 vs 90</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		  16.91 vs 14.09</p>
<p> Net sales					    493 vs 417</p>
<p> Operating profit				   112 vs 83</p>
<p> Proposed dividend				 5.50 vs 5.00</p>
<p> Extraordinary items				nil vs 10 gain</p>
<p> Profit before appropriations, taxes	  112 vs 100</p>
<p> Net profit					    80 vs 70</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)		73 vs 71</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish meteorological equipment maker Vaisala Oy.</p>
